# --- exceptions to the blanket *.py rule above ---------------------------
# These four generate artifacts that ARE tracked, so without them those
# artifacts cannot be reproduced from the repo.  All four are verified to
# contain no credentials and to make no network calls.  Everything else
# stays ignored: 18 of the 36 .py files here reference API keys (read from
# external paths, not embedded), and the blanket rule is what keeps them out.
!disasm.py
!build_clean_disasm.py
!tools/
!tools/*.py
